      "name": "t:sections.n_guide-content.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "active": true,
        "must_read": false,
        "heading": "Product Information",
        "text": "<h2>Product Information</h2><p>Blue+ is a lightweight, LED-enhancing serum designed to be applied before an LED session, working with your Q-Rejuvalight Pro to help skin respond more effectively to light — without increasing intensity, heat, or irritation.</p><p>Hero active:</p><ul><li><strong>USP Methylene Blue (0.1%)</strong> - a cosmetic photosensitizer that helps skin absorb and convert LED light into stronger cellular signaling, amplifying results from both Skin-Clearing (blue light) and Skin-Rejuvenating (red light) modes.</li></ul><p>Supporting actives:</p><ul><li><strong>Calendula iActive</strong> soothes and comforts skin, with added antioxidant support for skin exposed to daily screen/blue light</li><li><strong>Niacinamide</strong> supports a healthy-looking barrier and more even-looking tone</li><li><strong>Beta-Glucan</strong> helps soothe the appearance of skin</li><li><strong>Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> delivers lightweight hydration</li><li><strong>Bisabolol + Allantoin</strong> support skin comfort</li><li><strong>Vitamin E (Tocopheryl Acetate)</strong> provides antioxidant support</li></ul>",
        "slides_per_view": ""
      }
    },
    "n_guide_content_Bq5hMz": {
      "type": "n_guide-content",
      "blocks": {
        "quote_Nc8vRd": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "style": "blue",
            "text": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> excess product may cause temporary staining — a pea-sized amount is all you need.</p>"
          }
        },
        "quote_Ug2fTy": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "style": "blue",
            "text": "<p>Can be used daily, with or without your LED session</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "quote_Nc8vRd",
        "quote_Ug2fTy"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.n_guide-content.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "active": false,
        "must_read": false,
        "heading": "Usage Instructions",
        "text": "<h2>Usage Instructions</h2><p><strong>How To Use (with Q-Rejuvalight Pro LED Mask):</strong></p><ol><li>Cleanse skin thoroughly.</li><li>Apply a pea-sized amount evenly to face and neck.</li><li>Allow a few minutes for absorption.</li><li>Apply the Q-Rejuvalight Pro LED Mask and run your selected treatment mode.</li><li>Do not rinse off — continue with your regular skincare routine after the LED session.</li></ol><p>[quote_1]</p><p><strong>How To Use (on its own):</strong></p><ol><li>Cleanse skin thoroughly.</li><li>Apply a pea-sized amount evenly to face and neck.</li><li>Massage in until fully absorbed.</li><li>Follow with your regular moisturizer or next skincare step.</li></ol><p>[quote_2]</p>",
        "slides_per_view": ""
      }
    },
    "n_guide_content_Xr6kDs": {
      "type": "n_guide-content",
      "name": "t:sections.n_guide-content.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "active": false,
        "must_read": false,
        "heading": "Product Claims",
        "text": "<h2>Product Claims</h2><p>Key claims:</p><ul><li>Formulated to enhance the biological effectiveness of LED light, helping each session work harder without increasing intensity or irritation.</li><li>Powered by USP Methylene Blue, a cosmetic photosensitizer that amplifies results from both Skin-Clearing and Skin-Rejuvenating LED modes.</li><li>Supports a soothed, comfortable skin feel during and after LED use.</li><li>Dermatologically tested, hypoallergenic, and suitable for sensitive skin.</li><li>Fragrance-free, vegan, and cruelty-free.</li></ul>",
        "slides_per_view": ""
      }
    },
    "n_guide_content_Zy9tPw": {
      "type": "n_guide-content",
      "blocks": {
        "quote_Ke4bJq": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "style": "blue",
            "text": "<p>Remember to <strong>add a personal touch</strong> to the messaging, talk about how it feels going into your routine and any difference you've noticed in your sessions.</p><p>Examples:</p><ul><li>“My LED sessions actually feel like they're doing more now.”</li><li>“This is the step I never skip before my mask.”</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "quote_Ke4bJq"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.n_guide-content.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "active": false,
        "must_read": true,
        "heading": "Content Requirements",
        "text": "<h2>Content Requirements</h2><p>Messaging must include:</p><ul><li>Blue+ can be used before your LED session — it's designed to enhance the Q-Rejuvalight Pro, or on its own.</li><li>Powered by USP Methylene Blue, a photosensitizer that helps skin respond more effectively to LED light.</li><li>Compatible with both Skin-Clearing (blue light) and Skin-Rejuvenating (red light) modes.</li><li>Lightweight, fast-absorbing, and non-irritating — safe for sensitive skin.</li><li>Do not rinse off before your LED session; continue your normal routine afterward.</li><li>Visible results build with consistent LED + Blue+ use.</li></ul><p>[quote_1]</p>",
        "slides_per_view": ""
      }
    },
