        "heading": "Creative Direction",
        "text": "<h2>Creative Direction</h2><p>Recording Guidelines</p><ul><li>Use bright, natural lighting. No filters.</li><li>Please do not wear makeup (unless to show makeup removal).</li><li>Show the full routine: applying Blue+, then putting on the Q-Rejuvalight Pro LED Mask.</li><li>Keep backgrounds clean and uncluttered.</li><li>In cover photos, always show the serum in use (unless agreed otherwise).</li><li>Because the serum has a blue tint, a close-up of it on skin or on the applicator makes for a strong visual — feel free to highlight this.</li></ul>",
